{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/bearzerklogoResizeSmall.png?t=1745524695\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bearzerk is a twisted teddy world where you harness bizarre plush powers, gather an arsenal of wacky weapons, and crush wave after wave of stitched nightmares. Survive 20 grueling round and choose from a whole bunch of teddy heroes, each with their own monstrous quirks and synergy potential. It\u2019s an auto-shooter that focuses on creative builds, combos, and endless plush pandemonium.  <br>  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/double_banner.png?t=1745524695\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features (Early Access)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15 Playable Characters</strong>: From raging ragdolls to warped wizards, each bears unique traits for outlandish playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20 Weapons &amp; 60+ Armor Items/Perks</strong>: Patch together insane combos with bizarre buffs and lethal fluff-laced armaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There's a goat.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/goat__1_.png?t=1745524695\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wave-Based Madness</strong>: Survive 20 intense rounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bosses ?</strong> of course there's bosses. And we're only going to add more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: Feeling overstuffed? Dive into endless rounds and see how long your plush can stand the fury.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Building Runs</strong>: Customize your teddy\u2019s loadout each run, layering synergy-rich upgrades to mow down enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scroll of Stitches (Meta Unlocks)</strong>: Earn permanent power boosts by leveling up your plush prowess, ensuring each new run feels bigger and badder than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Future Content</strong>: New maps, playable characters, mini-bosses, and more plush-pounding encounters planned throughout Early Access.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/mega_doug_transparent.png?t=1745524695\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong><i>Big guys - big glory.\u00a0</i></strong><br><br><br>Bearzerk arrives in Early Access soon\u2014brace yourself for a realm where cute meets chaotic, and every patchwork hero is just a stitch away from total mayhem. We will be adding content\u00a0 just about as fast as we can - jump in and get your fluff stuffed.\u00a0\u00a0 <br>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3545290?t=1745524695","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3545290?t=1745524695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/a2cd5033d1d01c99ff59ecb978d7e00ee03a7a35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745524695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/a2cd5033d1d01c99ff59ecb978d7e00ee03a7a35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745524695","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com