 Unlocks)</strong>: Earn permanent power boosts by leveling up your plush prowess, ensuring each new run feels bigger and badder than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Future Content</strong>: New maps, playable characters, mini-bosses, and more plush-pounding encounters planned throughout Early Access.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/mega_doug_transparent.png?t=1745524695\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong><i>Big guys - big glory.\u00a0</i></strong><br><br><br>Bearzerk arrives in Early Access soon\u2014brace yourself for a realm where cute meets chaotic, and every patchwork hero is just a stitch away from total mayhem. We will be adding content\u00a0 just about as fast as we can - jump in and get your fluff stuffed.\u00a0\u00a0 <br>  </p>","developers":["Dadbod Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/d35f1e2bb53b5f672ce338224d37a87213e7b887/header.jpg?t=1745524695","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 3+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU: 8 RDNA 2 CU'<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Certain menu items are somewhat over response when using a controller. This wil be fixed durng early access development.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 eller Intel Core M</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong